&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMjLCMXYFmlqC3ZbrR4tpWL2pgKch_fnmg7Dd8MqA249A&oe=6ACA5AAD"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Deep Ocean Dive: Underwater Adventure", "keywords": ["Ocean", "Underwater", "Dive", "Marine", "Sea"], "long_description": "**Leave the surface behind and dive into a breathtaking open-world ocean where adventure awaits beyond every reef. Explore a massive underwater world filled with vibrant coral gardens, mysterious caves, ancient ruins, hidden treasures, and incredible marine life in immersive VR.**\n\nDiscover over 30 unique marine species as you build your living Ocean Encyclopedia, from colorful tropical fish and graceful sea turtles to powerful sharks, majestic whales, and legendary sea creatures hidden in the deepest waters.\n\nSwim freely without boundaries and uncover diverse underwater biomes, forgotten civilizations, secret shipwrecks, and breathtaking locations inspired by the beauty and mystery of the real ocean. Every dive rewards curiosity with new discoveries, rare collectibles, and unforgettable encounters.\n\nWhether you're searching for legendary creatures, completing your encyclopedia, uncovering ancient secrets, or simply relaxing beneath the waves, every journey offers a new experience. Live the dream of exploring an underwater world few people will ever see in real life\u2014without fear, without limits, and from the comfort of your own home.\n", "short_description": "Dive into a massive open-world ocean where every journey reveals new marine life, hidden treasures, ancient ruins, and legendary sea creatures. Explore, relax, and experience the underwater world you've always dreamed of discovering in immersive VR."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://gravitylabs1.wixsite.com/website-1", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Gravity Labs", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://gravitylabs